UPDATE public.legal_documents SET title_ru = 'Условия использования и EULA', content_ru = '<h1>Anacan — Условия использования и Лицензионное соглашение с конечным пользователем (EULA)</h1>

<h2>1. Общие положения</h2>
<p>Настоящие Условия использования ("Условия") регулируют использование вами мобильного приложения "Anacan" ("Приложение"). Загружая или используя Приложение, вы подтверждаете свое согласие с настоящими Условиями и стандартным Лицензионным соглашением Apple с конечным пользователем (EULA).</p>

<h2>2. Подписки и платежи</h2>
<p>Приложение "Anacan" предлагает пользователям автоматически возобновляемые подписки для доступа к функциям Premium. В отношении подписок действуют следующие правила:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Оплата:</strong> После подтверждения покупки оплата будет списана с вашей учетной записи Apple ID (App Store).</li>
<li><strong>Автоматическое продление:</strong> Если подписка не будет отменена (автоматическое продление не будет отключено) не позднее чем за 24 часа до окончания текущего периода, она будет автоматически продлена на тот же срок и по той же цене.</li>
<li><strong>Списание средств:</strong> В течение 24 часов до окончания текущего периода подписки с вашей учетной записи будет списана соответствующая сумма за ее продление.</li>
<li><strong>Управление подпиской:</strong> Пользователи могут самостоятельно управлять своими подписками. После покупки автоматическое продление можно отключить в разделе "Настройки учетной записи" (Account Settings) в App Store.</li>
<li><strong>Отмена:</strong> Отмена текущей подписки в течение активного периода подписки не допускается. Отмена вступит в силу только со следующего периода.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Лицензия</h2>
<p>Приложение "Anacan" предоставляет вам ограниченную, отзывную и непередаваемую лицензию на использование Приложения в личных некоммерческих целях.</p>

<h2>4. Контакты</h2>
<p>Если у вас возникнут вопросы или жалобы, вы можете связаться с нами: <a href="mailto:info@anacan.az">info@anacan.az</a></p>', title_tr = 'Kullanım Koşulları ve EULA', content_tr = '<h1>Anacan - Kullanım Koşulları ve Son Kullanıcı Lisans Sözleşmesi (EULA)</h1>

<h2>1. Genel Hükümler</h2>
<p>Bu Kullanım Koşulları ("Koşullar"), "Anacan" mobil uygulamasını ("Uygulama") kullanımınızı düzenler. Uygulamayı indirerek veya kullanarak bu Koşulları ve Apple''ın standart Son Kullanıcı Lisans Sözleşmesi''ni (EULA) kabul ettiğinizi onaylarsınız.</p>

<h2>2. Abonelikler ve Ödemeler</h2>
<p>"Anacan" uygulaması, kullanıcılara premium özelliklere erişim için otomatik yenilenen abonelikler sunar. Aboneliklere ilişkin kurallar aşağıdaki gibidir:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Ödeme:</strong> Satın alma işlemi onaylandıktan sonra ödeme, Apple ID (App Store) hesabınızdan tahsil edilecektir.</li>
<li><strong>Otomatik Yenileme:</strong> Abonelik, mevcut dönemin sona ermesinden en az 24 saat önce iptal edilmezse (otomatik yenileme kapatılmazsa) aynı süre ve aynı fiyatla otomatik olarak yenilenecektir.</li>
<li><strong>Hesaptan Tahsilat:</strong> Mevcut abonelik döneminin sona ermesinden önceki 24 saat içinde yenileme için ilgili tutar hesabınızdan tahsil edilecektir.</li>
<li><strong>Abonelik Yönetimi:</strong> Kullanıcılar aboneliklerini yönetebilir. Satın alma işleminden sonra App Store''daki "Hesap Ayarları" (Account Settings) bölümüne girerek otomatik yenilemeyi kapatmak mümkündür.</li>
<li><strong>İptal:</strong> Etkin abonelik dönemi boyunca mevcut aboneliğin iptal edilmesine izin verilmez. İptal işlemi yalnızca bir sonraki dönem için geçerli olacaktır.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Lisans</h2>
<p>"Anacan" uygulaması, uygulamayı kişisel ve ticari olmayan amaçlarla kullanmanıza olanak tanıyan sınırlı, geri alınabilir ve devredilemez bir lisans sunar.</p>

<h2>4. İletişim</h2>
<p>Herhangi bir sorunuz veya şikâyetiniz varsa bizimle iletişime geçebilirsiniz: <a href="mailto:info@anacan.az">info@anacan.az</a></p>', title_en = 'Terms of Use and EULA', content_en = '<h1>Anacan - Terms of Use and End User License Agreement (EULA)</h1>

<h2>1. General Provisions</h2>
<p>These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your use of the "Anacan" mobile application ("App"). By downloading or using the App, you confirm that you accept these Terms and Apple''s standard End User License Agreement (EULA).</p>

<h2>2. Subscriptions and Payments</h2>
<p>The "Anacan" App offers users auto-renewable subscriptions that provide access to premium features. The following terms apply to subscriptions:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Payment:</strong> Once your purchase is confirmed, payment will be charged to your Apple ID (App Store) account.</li>
<li><strong>Automatic Renewal:</strong> Unless the subscription is canceled (automatic renewal is turned off) at least 24 hours before the end of the current period, it will automatically renew for the same duration and at the same price.</li>
<li><strong>Renewal Charge:</strong> Your account will be charged the applicable renewal amount within 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period.</li>
<li><strong>Subscription Management:</strong> Users can manage their subscriptions. After purchase, automatic renewal can be turned off by going to "Account Settings" in the App Store.</li>
<li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> The current subscription cannot be canceled during an active subscription period. Cancellation will only take effect for the next period.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. License</h2>
<p>The "Anacan" App grants you a limited, revocable, and non-transferable license to use the App for personal, non-commercial purposes.</p>

<h2>4. Contact</h2>
<p>If you have any questions or complaints, you can contact us at: <a href="mailto:info@anacan.az">info@anacan.az</a></p>', title = CASE WHEN length(coalesce(title, '')) < 5 THEN 'Terms of Use and EULA' ELSE title END, content = CASE WHEN length(coalesce(content, '')) < 50 THEN '<h1>Anacan - Terms of Use and End User License Agreement (EULA)</h1>

<h2>1. General Provisions</h2>
<p>These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your use of the "Anacan" mobile application ("App"). By downloading or using the App, you confirm that you accept these Terms and Apple''s standard End User License Agreement (EULA).</p>

<h2>2. Subscriptions and Payments</h2>
<p>The "Anacan" App offers users auto-renewable subscriptions that provide access to premium features. The following terms apply to subscriptions:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Payment:</strong> Once your purchase is confirmed, payment will be charged to your Apple ID (App Store) account.</li>
<li><strong>Automatic Renewal:</strong> Unless the subscription is canceled (automatic renewal is turned off) at least 24 hours before the end of the current period, it will automatically renew for the same duration and at the same price.</li>
<li><strong>Renewal Charge:</strong> Your account will be charged the applicable renewal amount within 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period.</li>
<li><strong>Subscription Management:</strong> Users can manage their subscriptions. After purchase, automatic renewal can be turned off by going to "Account Settings" in the App Store.</li>
<li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> The current subscription cannot be canceled during an active subscription period. Cancellation will only take effect for the next period.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. License</h2>
<p>The "Anacan" App grants you a limited, revocable, and non-transferable license to use the App for personal, non-commercial purposes.</p>

<h2>4. Contact</h2>
